ORD


// The right arm waves for 3 beats while the head nods once on each beat

gram#2[1] Hello --> {wave _ _ waveoff, nod nod nod nod}


// Four claps on the beats, three nods against them, the torso swinging

gram#2[2] Claps --> {armsup clap clap clap clap armsdown, - {4, nod nod nod} -, Sway6}
gram#2[3] Sway6 --> _ins(torso) _cont(torso) _value(torso,0) C4 _value(torso,10) C4 _value(torso,-10) C4 _value(torso,10) C4 _value(torso,-10) C4 _value(torso,10) C4 _value(torso,0)


// A short wave and a long wave: the long one repeats its waving part more times, at the same speed

gram#2[4] Waves --> wave _ waveoff - wave _ _ _ _ _ waveoff -


// Twice as fast: "armsup" and "armsdown" are twice as fast, the claps keep their speed and their impacts stay on the beats.
// The nods are compressed to half their duration, which is their limit: a faster tempo would not make them faster.

gram#2[5] FastClaps --> _tempo(2) {armsup clap clap clap clap clap clap clap clap armsdown, - nod nod nod nod nod nod nod nod -} _tempo(1)


// Wave goodbye

gram#2[6] Bye --> {wave _ _ _ _ waveoff, nod - nod - nod -}